<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Function">
  <data key="d0">Function</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Function is a named software procedure and programming construct that organizes code as the first line of organization in a program. It is a code unit, code routine, and unit of behavior, as well as a named operation that may receive arguments, return values, and be understood through its signature and call sites.

In design, a function should be declared in an appropriate location and defined close to where it is used. Its name should reveal its purpose, behavior, and usage, while its signature and call sites support comprehension. As a programming construct, it decomposes a larger concept into a set of steps at the next level of abstraction, making intent clear and sometimes replacing an explanatory comment.

Function should perform one responsibility, know as few variables as possible, and be structured under the one entry, one exit rule. These qualities make it a cohesive, well-located, and clearly named code unit that supports organized, readable, and maintainable software.&lt;SEP&gt;A function is a unit of code, and the input states that blank lines separate each function in Listing 5-1.&lt;SEP&gt;Function is an executable behavior or operation in software; objects expose functions or behavior, data structures have no significant functions, and hybrid structures include functions that do significant things.&lt;SEP&gt;A software function needing change, called by another function, and potentially overridden.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f209a7a16ee116e66dcaca0799c06baa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ecee1e439eb5fb52d346911e1683e490-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf9b0cb392cf6be9fae672222887f4bd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-006</data>
