<node id="FitNesse">
  <data key="d0">FitNesse</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">FitNesse is an open-source, wiki-based acceptance testing system in which acceptance tests are authored and executed as wiki pages. It is used as a testing tool to express expected behavior for methods such as Args, and it has been cited as the source of illustrative Java examples, including one demonstrating explanatory variables.

FitNesse’s software architecture includes Java source files that begin with a standard comment header and are released under the GNU General Public License Version 2. A referenced version associated with the codebase is 20070619, and its sources include files such as HtmlUtil.java. Its application-level behavior involves early parsing of command-line arguments, with default configuration values defined in the Arguments class.

The FitNesse codebase has also been referenced as the origin of specific example code and snippets. These include examples involving the AliasLinkWidget and HruleWidget, a Java example containing doRename, renamePage, pathToRename, and PathParser.render, and an example in which a mumbling comment was found.&lt;SEP&gt;FitNesse is a Java project depicted in the file length distribution figure, described as close to 50,000 lines and composed of relatively small files.&lt;SEP&gt;FitNesse is the source project referenced for the WikiPageResponder.java listing used to illustrate dependent functions.&lt;SEP&gt;A software project or framework providing the code shown in Listing 9-1.&lt;SEP&gt;A name appearing in the URL fitnesse.org/FitNesse.AcceptanceTestPatterns that identifies the host of the referenced FitNesse Acceptance Test Patterns page.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ecee1e439eb5fb52d346911e1683e490-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ecee1e439eb5fb52d346911e1683e490-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ecee1e439eb5fb52d346911e1683e490-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ecee1e439eb5fb52d346911e1683e490-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e6b59836a05af0c112c0d24b77e2c123-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e6b59836a05af0c112c0d24b77e2c123-chunk-003</data>
