<node id="Kent Beck">
  <data key="d0">Kent Beck</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Kent Beck is a software developer and author widely associated with the evolution of extreme programming (XP) and simple design. He is identified as the person associated with the four rules of Simple Design and as a developer who made the rule against duplication one of the core principles of Extreme Programming. His book *Extreme Programming Explained: Embrace Change* further documents these ideas.

Beck is also a software author known for works on Smalltalk and software design. He is listed as the author of *Smalltalk Best Practice Patterns* and *Implementation Patterns*, and he wrote about explanatory variables in *Smalltalk Best Practice Patterns*, with his books cited for the guideline about using explanatory variables.

In addition to authorship, Kent Beck is recognized as a co-creator of JUnit and as the author of the *JUnit Pocket Guide*, with associations to a Smalltalk testing framework. He is also described as the person who taught test-driven development to the Narrator in 1999.&lt;SEP&gt;Kent Beck is a person who, in 1999, was visited at a home in Oregon and showed a Java/Swing program called Sparkle during a programming session.&lt;SEP&gt;Kent Beck is a person who refactored a code module into a more pleasant form in front of several dozen enthusiastic students.&lt;SEP&gt;Kent Beck is the author of Test Driven Development.&lt;SEP&gt;Kent Beck is a referenced author whose book Implementation Patterns is cited in the Clean Code chapter as stating that good code matters.&lt;SEP&gt;A person listed as the author of Implementation Patterns.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d813b42e06df0d7b6f90cb9e254aaf18-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d813b42e06df0d7b6f90cb9e254aaf18-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-17d57202bcc8986bfbb2e844fedcd248-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-046&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ecee1e439eb5fb52d346911e1683e490-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-207d517b4dd92803d5557692307191fb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-006</data>
