<node id="Do One Thing">
  <data key="d0">Do One Thing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Do One Thing is a referenced section on page 35 related to the function guideline.&lt;SEP&gt;Do One Thing is a principle that a function should perform a single responsibility, which checkPasswordAndInitializeSession would violate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-006</data>
