<node id="Ruby">
  <data key="d0">Ruby</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Ruby is a programming language in which the argument parsing module was rewritten to one seventh of the Java size and with a subtly better structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Ruby is a programming language mentioned as using def in the same role that LOGO uses TO.&lt;SEP&gt;Ruby is a programming language mentioned as not having Checked Exceptions while still allowing Robust Software.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98268aa1e2e5692cb0faaf2b6fae4a09-chunk-001</data>
