</node>
<node id="Boolean">
  <data key="d0">Boolean</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Boolean is a Java type used in the Args.java first draft for boolean argument values stored in a map keyed by Character.&lt;SEP&gt;Boolean is a Java boolean wrapper class used by Args when casting the Object returned by ArgumentMarshaler get for boolean arguments.&lt;SEP&gt;Boolean is the Java Boolean type used as the cast target in GetBoolean.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790601715</data>
