  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">System is the overall computer system that contained terminals and had to be shut down and restarted.&lt;SEP&gt;Java class used to print server status messages through System.out.printf.&lt;SEP&gt;Built from a domain-specific language and told as a story rather than treated only as a program to be written.</data>
