<node id="Programmers">
  <data key="d0">Programmers</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Programmers are human individuals who may satisfy themselves with merely working code and may fear lacking time to improve code structure and design.&lt;SEP&gt;People who design a domain-specific language to describe a system.&lt;SEP&gt;Human individuals who write modules, code, and comments; the text states that programmers cannot realistically maintain comments and should make code clear and expressive.&lt;SEP&gt;Programmers are professionals expected to defend code with professional honor, keep code clean, and not lie about the state of code or schedule.</data>
