  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object Oriented Software is a 1996 book by Gamma et al. published by Addison-Wesley.&lt;SEP&gt;Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object Oriented Software is a book by Gamma et al. published by Addison-Wesley in 1996, listed in the bibliography.&lt;SEP&gt;Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object Oriented Software is a 1996 book by Gamma et al., published by Addison-Wesley.&lt;SEP&gt;Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object Oriented Software is a book by Gamma et al. published by Addison-Wesley in 1996 and referenced for the Adapter Pattern.&lt;SEP&gt;A 1996 book by Gamma et al. published by Addison-Wesley.&lt;SEP&gt;Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object Oriented Software is a book authored by Gamma Et Al and published by Addison-Wesley in 1996.</data>
