  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Dave Thomas is a co-author of The Pragmatic Programmer.&lt;SEP&gt;An author who called the rule against duplication the DRY principle.&lt;SEP&gt;Dave Thomas is a person listed as an author of The Pragmatic Programmer in the bibliography.&lt;SEP&gt;Dave Thomas is an author named in the bibliography entry for The Pragmatic Programmer.&lt;SEP&gt;Dave Thomas is a software author and founder of OTI, described as Pragmatic Dave Thomas and Big Dave Thomas, and advocates clean code that is readable, testable, minimal, and literate.</data>
