<node id="Documentation">
  <data key="d0">Documentation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Documentation is external explanation of a function that, if required to understand the function's behavior, indicates a naming problem.&lt;SEP&gt;Third-party introductory documentation and Log4j documentation consulted to learn package usage.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-207d517b4dd92803d5557692307191fb-chunk-001</data>
