  <data key="d0">TestNG</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A source of the example method getOos that lazily creates and returns an ObjectOutputStream.&lt;SEP&gt;TestNG is a software testing framework cited as the source of the GetOos code example.&lt;SEP&gt;TestNG is one of seven projects depicted in the file length distribution figure, though the input does not specify whether the files are small or large.&lt;SEP&gt;TestNG is a testing framework referenced as the source of a long function snippet that processes XmlTest objects.</data>
