  <data key="d0">Listing 15-5</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Listing 15-5 is a numbered book listing titled ComparisonCompactor.java (final) that presents the final refactored source code for ComparisonCompactor.&lt;SEP&gt;Listing 15-5 is a source-code listing on page 263 referenced as an even better example of vertical ordering.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-17d57202bcc8986bfbb2e844fedcd248-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-003</data>
