  <data key="d0">Good Software Design</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Good Software Design is the desirable quality of software that follows clean, simple, cohesive, and low-coupling design practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d813b42e06df0d7b6f90cb9e254aaf18-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-12.txt</data>
