<node id="Template Method Pattern">
  <data key="d0">Template Method Pattern</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A design pattern used to remove higher-level duplication by defining a fixed algorithm skeleton in an abstract class and leaving abstract steps for subclasses to implement.&lt;SEP&gt;A design pattern used to address subtle duplication in modules that have similar algorithms but do not share similar lines of code.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d813b42e06df0d7b6f90cb9e254aaf18-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-12.txt&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-17.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790596259</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reuse In The Small">
  <data key="d0">Reuse In The Small</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Small-scale reuse of newly extracted methods in different contexts, which can dramatically shrink system complexity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d813b42e06df0d7b6f90cb9e254aaf18-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-12.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790593524</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reuse In The Large">
  <data key="d0">Reuse In The Large</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Large-scale software reuse that depends on understanding and achieving small-scale reuse.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d813b42e06df0d7b6f90cb9e254aaf18-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-12.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790593524</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
