  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Code that clearly expresses author intent through good names, small functions and classes, standard nomenclature, and careful workmanship.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d813b42e06df0d7b6f90cb9e254aaf18-chunk-001</data>
