  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Classes mentioned in a dogmatic practice of separating fields from behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Classes are classes in which fields are separated from behavior, mentioned as an example of dogmatic design separation.</data>
