  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A Java source file identified as containing the original implementation of ComparisonCompactor.&lt;SEP&gt;ComparisonCompactor.java is the Java source file shown in Listing 15-5 that contains the final implementation of the ComparisonCompactor class.&lt;SEP&gt;ComparisonCompactor.java is the Java source file represented by Listing 15-4.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-17d57202bcc8986bfbb2e844fedcd248-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-17d57202bcc8986bfbb2e844fedcd248-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-17d57202bcc8986bfbb2e844fedcd248-chunk-005</data>
