<node id="Extreme Programming">
  <data key="d0">Extreme Programming</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A software development approach in which Kent Beck called the duplication rule Once, and only once.&lt;SEP&gt;A method coinvented by Ward Cunningham and referenced in Ron Jeffries' book titles.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-004</data>
