  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ron Jeffries">
  <data key="d0">Ron Jeffries</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A developer who ranks the rule against duplication second, just below getting all the tests to pass.&lt;SEP&gt;The author of Extreme Programming Installed and Extreme Programming Adventures in C#, who began a career in Fortran at Strategic Air Command and discusses simple code, duplication, expressiveness, and abstractions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-004</data>
