  <data key="d0">HourlyReporter.java</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">HourlyReporter.java is a Java source code listing that defines the HourlyReporter class and its LineItem class.&lt;SEP&gt;HourlyReporter.java is a Java source file listed in Listing 17-1 and contains the HourlyReporter class.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-17.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790596259</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PAGE_SIZE">
  <data key="d0">PAGE_SIZE</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">PAGE_SIZE is a constant in HourlyReporter that determines when a report page contains enough line items to be printed.&lt;SEP&gt;PAGE_SIZE is a constant declared in HourlyReporter that represents a page size of 55.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-006</data>
