  <data key="d0">G21</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">G21 is the guideline identifier for the Understand The Algorithm rule.&lt;SEP&gt;G21 is an index entry labeled G21 that is listed with the page references 16-291 and 17-310.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-045</data>
