  <data key="d0">Date Add Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Date Add Method is the method invoked as date.add(5) in the function naming example, and its behavior is not clear from the call.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-17.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790596259</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="addDaysTo">
  <data key="d0">addDaysTo</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">addDaysTo is a proposed method name for a Date operation that adds five days to the date and changes the date instance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-17.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790596259</data>
