</node>
<node id="daysLater">
  <data key="d0">daysLater</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">daysLater is a proposed method name for a Date operation that returns a new date five days later without changing the original date instance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-17.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790596259</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="daysSince">
  <data key="d0">daysSince</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">daysSince is an alternative proposed method name for a Date operation that returns a later date without changing the original date instance.&lt;SEP&gt;daysSince is the renamed version of compare in DayDate that returns the difference in days since an argument, and tests are written for daysSince.&lt;SEP&gt;daysSince is a date method invoked by SpreadsheetDate.compareTo to compute the day difference between SpreadsheetDate and a DayDate argument.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-044</data>
