<node id="main">
  <data key="d0">main</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">main is a static method in FitNesse that begins execution and receives Command-Line Arguments.&lt;SEP&gt;main is the static entry point in BobsSerialDateTest that runs junit.textui.TestRunner for BobsSerialDateTest.class.&lt;SEP&gt;main is the static entry point method in PrimePrinter. The main method defines constants, obtains prime numbers, creates a table printer, and starts printing.</data>
