<node id="isStrike">
  <data key="d0">isStrike</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">isStrike is a boolean method that determines whether a bowling frame is a strike by checking whether rolls[frame] equals 10.&lt;SEP&gt;A private Java method that checks whether the roll for a given frame equals ten by comparing rolls[frame] to 10.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-011</data>
