  <data key="d0">Ward Cunningham</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A person cited for a quote associated with the expectation of the isStrike method.&lt;SEP&gt;Ward Cunningham is referenced in a footnote as the source of a quote on page 11 related to readable code and expected behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;A person described as the inventor of Wiki and Fit, a coinventor of Extreme Programming, a motive force behind Design Patterns, and a Smalltalk and object-oriented thought leader.</data>
