  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A conventional Java function name used for functions that convert objects to string representations.&lt;SEP&gt;toString is a method added to the Day enumeration from weekdayCodeToString and to the Month enumeration from monthCodeToString, returning a full weekday or month name.&lt;SEP&gt;A method that returns the full month name from dateFormatSymbols.getMonths() using an index offset.&lt;SEP&gt;A SerialDate method that converts the date to a string using day, month code, and year components.</data>
