<node id="N2: Choose Names at the Appropriate Level of Abstraction">
  <data key="d0">N2: Choose Names at the Appropriate Level of Abstraction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A naming guideline directing names to match the abstraction level of the class or function rather than implementation details.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-011</data>
