</node>
<node id="Test Cases">
  <data key="d0">Test Cases</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Test Cases are individual test units whose failure patterns can reveal problems and that should be made as complete as possible.&lt;SEP&gt;Test Cases are the verification cases needed to ensure that combinations of argument values behave correctly, and their number grows with argument count.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0af28655754ee82c5f5f3411cf8f5c39-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-17.txt&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-03.txt</data>
