  <data key="d0">java.util.Calendar</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">java.util.Calendar is a date-related class in Java mentioned as an existing class when considering the purpose of SerialDate.&lt;SEP&gt;java.util.Calendar is a Java calendar class imported by SpreadsheetDate.java.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-032</data>
