</node>
<node id="SerialDateTests">
  <data key="d0">SerialDateTests</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">SerialDateTests is a class containing initial unit tests for SerialDate; the tests all pass but do not test every behavior in SerialDate.&lt;SEP&gt;SerialDateTests is a Java test class defined in SerialDateTests.java that extends TestCase and contains JUnit tests for the SerialDate class.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-021</data>
