</node>
<node id="Clover">
  <data key="d0">Clover</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Clover is a test coverage reporting tool, and the coverage pattern from Clover shows that line 719 of the SerialDate code never executes.&lt;SEP&gt;Clover is a tool used to report unit-test coverage for SerialDate, showing initial SerialDateTests coverage of 91 of 185 executable statements and newer independent unit test coverage of 170 of 185 executable statements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-001</data>
