  <data key="d0">Independent Unit Tests</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Independent Unit Tests is a suite of completely independent unit tests written for SerialDate, including some commented-out tests that represent behavior the tests expect SerialDate to have.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-16.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790596802</data>
