<node id="getPreviousDayOfWeek">
  <data key="d0">getPreviousDayOfWeek</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">getPreviousDayOfWeek is a SerialDate method for previous weekday calculations and was included in an earlier repair.&lt;SEP&gt;DayDate method that returns a date created by addDays.&lt;SEP&gt;SerialDate day-of-week method changed to correct bugs in a 2001 update.&lt;SEP&gt;getPreviousDayOfWeek is a method of SerialDate changed to correct bugs according to the change history.&lt;SEP&gt;getPreviousDayOfWeek is a static SerialDate method that returns the latest date before a base date that falls on a specified day-of-the-week.&lt;SEP&gt;getPreviousDayOfWeek is a method of SerialDate that returns the latest date before the current SerialDate that falls on a specified day-of-the-week.&lt;SEP&gt;A date calculation method invoked to determine the previous occurrence of a specified day of week before a given date.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-029</data>
