<node id="Ordinal">
  <data key="d0">Ordinal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ordinal is a suggested alternative term for the date representation used by SerialDate because Ordinal better describes an offset-based value.&lt;SEP&gt;Ordinal is the proposed descriptive term for the date representation, replacing the less descriptive serial number term.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-002</data>
