<node id="isValidMonthCode">
  <data key="d0">isValidMonthCode</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">isValidMonthCode is a method that validates integer month codes and is removed when Month replaces raw month codes.&lt;SEP&gt;isValidMonthCode is a month validation function that becomes irrelevant and is deleted because of the Month enum.&lt;SEP&gt;isValidMonthCode is a method referenced by monthCodeToString to verify that a supplied month code is within the valid month range.&lt;SEP&gt;isValidMonthCode is a method that validates a month code and is exercised by testIsValidMonthCode.&lt;SEP&gt;A validation method referenced in the test fragment that checks whether a month code is valid.</data>
