<node id="monthCodeToQuarter">
  <data key="d0">monthCodeToQuarter</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">monthCodeToQuarter is a method containing month code error checking that is affected by replacing integer month codes with the Month enum.&lt;SEP&gt;monthCodeToQuarter is a function that converts a month code to a quarter, is described as exhibiting feature envy, and is replaced by a method in the Month enum.&lt;SEP&gt;monthCodeToQuarter is a static method in SerialDate.Java that maps a month code constant to its corresponding quarter, returning 1 through 4 and throwing an exception for invalid codes.&lt;SEP&gt;monthCodeToQuarter is a method that converts a month code to a quarter value and is exercised by testMonthToQuarter.&lt;SEP&gt;A conversion method that maps a valid month code to a quarter number and throws IllegalArgumentException for invalid month code -1.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-026</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-16.txt&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-18.txt</data>
