<node id="Relative Offset">
  <data key="d0">Relative Offset</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Relative Offset is the characterization of the date representation as being closer to an offset than to a true serial number.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-002</data>
