<node id="Month.make">
  <data key="d0">Month.make</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Month.make is a static method of Month that returns the Month enumerator matching a supplied month index and throws IllegalArgumentException when the index is invalid.&lt;SEP&gt;Month.make is the original enum construction method name for Month before being renamed.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-008</data>
