<node id="Month.values">
  <data key="d0">Month.values</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Month.values is a method of Month that is used by Month.make to iterate over all available Month enumerators.&lt;SEP&gt;Month.values is the enum values method of Month that returns all Month constants; Month.parse iterates over Month.values to find a matching Month constant.&lt;SEP&gt;Month.values is a method invoked by Month.fromInt to enumerate all Month enum values during index lookup.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-041</data>
