  <data key="d0">Automatic Control of Serialization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Automatic Control of Serialization is the serialization strategy in which the compiler generates serialVersionUID, making serialization changes visible as InvalidClassException.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-002</data>
