  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Reviewers are the people who reviewed the text and took exception to deleting serialVersionUID from DayDate.&lt;SEP&gt;Reviewers of the text who object to the decision about manual control of serial IDs in an open source framework.</data>
