<node id="Quarter">
  <data key="d0">Quarter</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Quarter is the time period returned by monthCodeToQuarter from a month code.&lt;SEP&gt;Quarter is the quarter of the year derived from a month code in SerialDate.&lt;SEP&gt;Quarter is the date abstraction represented by integer values 1 through 4 that monthCodeToQuarter returns for the corresponding months.&lt;SEP&gt;Quarter is a calendar division of the year represented by the quarter numbers 1 through 4 in the month-code to quarter conversion.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-026</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-16.txt&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599013</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Index Field">
  <data key="d0">Index Field</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Index Field is the final int field in Month that stores the numeric month index for each Month enumerator.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-16.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790596802</data>
