<node id="isValidWeekdayCode">
  <data key="d0">isValidWeekdayCode</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">isValidWeekdayCode is a method previously used to validate weekday codes that was deleted after the Day enumeration was created.&lt;SEP&gt;isValidWeekdayCode is a weekday validation method that is skipped or deleted because the Day enumeration supersedes its purpose.&lt;SEP&gt;isValidWeekdayCode is a public static method in SerialDate that returns true if an integer code represents a valid day-of-week and false otherwise.&lt;SEP&gt;isValidWeekdayCode is a static SerialDate method used to verify that a supplied day-of-the-week code is valid.&lt;SEP&gt;isValidWeekdayCode is a method that validates a weekday code and is exercised by testIsValidWeekdayCode.&lt;SEP&gt;A method associated with SerialDate that validates weekday codes and is called by the test method testIsValidWeekdayCode.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-025</data>
