  <data key="d5">1790599006</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="stringToWeekdayCode">
  <data key="d0">stringToWeekdayCode</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">stringToWeekdayCode is a method that converts a string to a weekday code and whose Javadoc is considered largely clutter except for the description of the -1 return value.&lt;SEP&gt;stringToWeekdayCode is a parsing method that converts a string to a weekday code, is moved into the Day enumeration as the parse function of Day, and has its Javadoc deleted as wrong and cluttered.&lt;SEP&gt;stringToWeekdayCode is a method that converts a weekday string to a weekday code and is exercised by testStringToWeekdayCode.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-025</data>
