  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">A Month enum constant representing February, used in lastDayOfMonth to adjust the last day when the year is a leap year.&lt;SEP&gt;FEBRUARY is a month constant used by lastDayOfMonth to identify February and determine whether the month should receive an extra day in a leap year.&lt;SEP&gt;FEBRUARY is a month constant used in the tests as a month-code value for the second calendar month.</data>
