<node id="DateUtil">
  <data key="d0">DateUtil</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">DateUtil is a new class that receives the static variable dateFormatSymbols and the static methods getMonthNames, isLeapYear, and lastDayOfMonth moved from DayDate.&lt;SEP&gt;DateUtil is a utility class referenced by DayDate.correctLastDayOfMonth to obtain the last day of a month for a given year.&lt;SEP&gt;DateUtil is a Java utility class referenced by DayDate.getEndOfMonth for obtaining the last day of a month through DateUtil.lastDayOfMonth.&lt;SEP&gt;A utility class whose lastDayOfMonth method is called by SpreadsheetDate to validate day arguments.&lt;SEP&gt;A Java class named DateUtil in the org.jfree.date package that provides static utility methods getMonthNames, isLeapYear, lastDayOfMonth, and leapYearCount.&lt;SEP&gt;DateUtil is a Java utility class referenced by SpreadsheetDate methods for leap-year counting and leap-year determination.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-044</data>
