  <data key="d0">getDayOfWeek</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">getDayOfWeek is a day-of-week calculation method originally in SpreadsheetDate that is moved to DayDate and calls getDayOfWeekForOrdinalZero and getOrdinalDay.&lt;SEP&gt;An abstract SerialDate method that returns the day of the week.&lt;SEP&gt;getDayOfWeek is a SerialDate accessor method called on a base date to retrieve the weekday code.&lt;SEP&gt;getDayOfWeek is a method that returns a day-of-week code calculated from the serial number, using codes defined in the SerialDate class.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-034</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-16.txt&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599048</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="getDayOfWeekForOrdinalZero">
  <data key="d0">getDayOfWeekForOrdinalZero</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">getDayOfWeekForOrdinalZero is an abstract method created in DayDate and implemented in SpreadsheetDate to provide the day of week for ordinal day zero.&lt;SEP&gt;getDayOfWeekForOrdinalZero is a protected SpreadsheetDate method that returns Day.SATURDAY for the day-of-week associated with ordinal zero.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-044</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-16.txt&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599080</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="getOrdinalDay">
  <data key="d0">getOrdinalDay</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">getOrdinalDay is a method called by getDayOfWeek and isInRange to obtain the ordinal day used in date calculations.&lt;SEP&gt;getOrdinalDay is a public SpreadsheetDate method that returns the ordinalDay value held by SpreadsheetDate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-044</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-16.txt&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-18.txt</data>
