  <data key="d0">Day.SATURDAY</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Day.SATURDAY is a Day enum constant returned by the SpreadsheetDate implementation of getDayOfWeekForOrdinalZero.&lt;SEP&gt;Day.SATURDAY is a Day enum constant representing Saturday and is initialized with Calendar.SATURDAY.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-041</data>
