<node id="Day.SUNDAY">
  <data key="d0">Day.SUNDAY</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Day.SUNDAY is a Day enum constant used in the getDayOfWeek calculation and in replacing the magic number 1.&lt;SEP&gt;Day.SUNDAY is a Day enum constant representing Sunday and is initialized with Calendar.SUNDAY.&lt;SEP&gt;Day.SUNDAY is a Day constant referenced as the base day for offset calculations in DayDate.getDayOfWeek.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-041</data>
