  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Month.JANUARY is a Month enum constant used to replace the magic number 1 in refactored code.&lt;SEP&gt;Month.JANUARY is a Month constant referenced in DayDate.plusMonths as the baseline month ordinal for month arithmetic.&lt;SEP&gt;Month.JANUARY is a Month constant referenced by DayDate.toDate to compute the zero-based ordinal month.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-040</data>
