  <data key="d0">Month.fromInt</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Month.fromInt is the renamed enum construction method for Month.&lt;SEP&gt;Month.fromInt is a method that returns the Month matching a supplied integer month index or throws IllegalArgumentException for an invalid index.&lt;SEP&gt;Month.fromInt is a method of Month that constructs or returns a Month value from an integer index; Month.parse invokes Month.fromInt as a fallback for numeric month input.&lt;SEP&gt;A static Month factory method used to create a Month value from an integer month value.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f738bd6b0c75b6d085747dd812187c7e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-043</data>
