<node id="Successive Refinement">
  <data key="d0">Successive Refinement</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Successive Refinement is a process of iteratively refining, refactoring, and cleaning a software module, as demonstrated in a case study.&lt;SEP&gt;Successive Refinement is a drafting process involving a rough draft, a second draft, and subsequent drafts until a final version.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598260</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chapter 14: Successive Refinement">
  <data key="d0">Chapter 14: Successive Refinement</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Chapter 14: Successive Refinement is a chapter that presents a case study of a command-line argument parser and describes how a module was refactored and cleaned.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598260</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Command-Line Argument Parser">
  <data key="d0">Command-Line Argument Parser</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Command-Line Argument Parser is a module or utility that parses command-line arguments, and the case-study subject started well but did not scale.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598260</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DoubleArgumentMarshaler">
  <data key="d0">DoubleArgumentMarshaler</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">DoubleArgumentMarshaler is an ArgumentMarshaler derivative referenced by the getDouble method for marshaling double command-line arguments by the same set and getValue pattern.&lt;SEP&gt;DoubleArgumentMarshaler is a marshaler created by Args for schema elements marked with double hashes.&lt;SEP&gt;DoubleArgumentMarshaler is a private class that implements ArgumentMarshaler and parses a double value from an iterator, storing the result in doubleValue.&lt;SEP&gt;DoubleArgumentMarshaler is an inner class of Args that marshals double arguments and reports missing or invalid double errors.&lt;SEP&gt;A concrete ArgumentMarshaler selected for schema elements with the ## suffix, representing double argument values.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598260</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="StringArrayArgumentMarshaler">
  <data key="d0">StringArrayArgumentMarshaler</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
