</node>
<node id="getInt">
  <data key="d0">getInt</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">getInt is a method that retrieves an int value for an argument character by delegating to IntegerArgumentMarshaler.getValue using the marshaler map.&lt;SEP&gt;Public Args accessor that returns an integer argument value using zeroIfNull when the stored value is null.&lt;SEP&gt;getInt is a method in Args that retrieves an Integer argument by character from the marshalers map and returns zero when an Exception occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;getInt is a method in Args that retrieves an integer argument value from intArgs and returns 0 when no ArgumentMarshaler exists.&lt;SEP&gt;Public method in Args that retrieves an integer argument value by character, returning zero when the marshaler is absent or an exception occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;getInt is a method called on an Args instance to retrieve a parsed integer value for an argument character.&lt;SEP&gt;A public accessor method of Args that returns the integer value associated with an argument character.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598334</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="getDouble">
  <data key="d0">getDouble</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">getDouble is a method that retrieves a double value for an argument character by delegating to DoubleArgumentMarshaler.getValue using the marshaler map.&lt;SEP&gt;getDouble is a public method that retrieves the marshaler for an argument character and returns its parsed value cast to Double, returning 0.0 when the marshaler is null or an exception occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;A public accessor method of Args that returns the double value associated with an argument character.</data>
