</node>
<node id="UNEXPECTED_ARGUMENT">
  <data key="d0">UNEXPECTED_ARGUMENT</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An ErrorCode constant in Args that indicates an argument character was not declared in the schema.&lt;SEP&gt;UNEXPECTED_ARGUMENT is an ArgsException.ErrorCode constant used when an argument character has no associated ArgumentMarshaler.&lt;SEP&gt;ErrorCode value indicating that one or more arguments were not expected by the schema.&lt;SEP&gt;Error code value representing that one or more unexpected arguments were supplied.&lt;SEP&gt;UNEXPECTED_ARGUMENT is an ArgsException.ErrorCode value representing an argument that was not expected.&lt;SEP&gt;UNEXPECTED_ARGUMENT is an ArgsException.ErrorCode constant asserted when an argument is provided without a corresponding schema entry.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
