</node>
<node id="ArgsException.java">
  <data key="d0">ArgsException.java</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">ArgsException.java is a Java source-file listing that defines the ArgsException class, including a constructor, accessors, an errorMessage method, and a nested ErrorCode enum.&lt;SEP&gt;A Java source file listing containing a fragment of the ArgsException class, including error message formatting for missing double parameters and the ErrorCode enumeration.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-020</data>
