<node id="Craft">
  <data key="d0">Craft</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Craft is a quality attributed to programming in the input, indicating that clean programs are produced through practice, successive refinement, and repeated effort.&lt;SEP&gt;Craft is the software craftsmanship that a code author cares deeply about when producing clean code.</data>
