<node id="Valid">
  <data key="d0">Valid</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Valid is a private boolean field declared in the Args class, initialized to true.&lt;SEP&gt;Valid is a boolean instance variable in Args that records whether argument parsing succeeded and is updated during parsing and argument dispatch.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-014</data>
