<node id="validateSchemaElementId">
  <data key="d0">validateSchemaElementId</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A private method in Args that throws ParseException if a schema element leading character is not a letter.&lt;SEP&gt;A method that ensures a schema element identifier is a letter and throws ParseException when it is not&lt;SEP&gt;validateSchemaElementId is a method in Args called by parseSchemaElement to validate an element identifier.&lt;SEP&gt;validateSchemaElementId is a method called by parseSchemaElement to check that a schema element identifier is valid.&lt;SEP&gt;A private method of Args that requires a schema element identifier to be a letter and throws ArgsException otherwise.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598396</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="parseBooleanSchemaElement">
  <data key="d0">parseBooleanSchemaElement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A private method in Args that initializes a boolean argument entry in booleanArgs to false.&lt;SEP&gt;A method that records a Boolean argument by storing a false initial value for a schema character in booleanArgs&lt;SEP&gt;Private Args method that stores a false value in booleanArgs for a letter character from the schema.&lt;SEP&gt;parseBooleanSchemaElement is a method that stores a false value in booleanArgs for a schema element identifier.&lt;SEP&gt;parseBooleanSchemaElement is a private method in Args that inserts a BooleanArgumentMarshaler into booleanArgs for a schema element.&lt;SEP&gt;parseBooleanSchemaElement is a method in Args that inserts a BooleanArgumentMarshaler into the marshalers map for a Boolean schema element.&lt;SEP&gt;parseBooleanSchemaElement is a method in Args that creates a BooleanArgumentMarshaler and registers it in booleanArgs and marshalers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
