<node id="parseIntegerSchemaElement">
  <data key="d0">parseIntegerSchemaElement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A private method in Args that initializes an integer argument entry in intArgs to zero.&lt;SEP&gt;parseIntegerSchemaElement is a method in Args that inserts an IntegerArgumentMarshaler into the marshalers map for an Integer schema element.&lt;SEP&gt;parseIntegerSchemaElement is a method in Args that creates an IntegerArgumentMarshaler and registers it in intArgs and marshalers.&lt;SEP&gt;parseIntegerSchemaElement is a private method in Args that registers an IntegerArgumentMarshaler in intArgs for an integer schema element.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-011</data>
