</node>
<node id="isBooleanSchemaElement">
  <data key="d0">isBooleanSchemaElement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A private method in Args that returns true when a schema element tail has length zero.&lt;SEP&gt;A method that identifies a Boolean schema element by checking whether the element tail has length zero&lt;SEP&gt;isBooleanSchemaElement is a method in Args called by parseSchemaElement to determine whether a schema element tail represents a Boolean element.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-011</data>
