<node id="isStringSchemaElement">
  <data key="d0">isStringSchemaElement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A private method in Args that returns true when a schema element tail equals *.&lt;SEP&gt;A method that identifies a String schema element by checking whether the element tail equals *&lt;SEP&gt;isStringSchemaElement is a method in Args called by parseSchemaElement to determine whether a schema element tail represents a String element.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-011</data>
