<node id="isIntegerSchemaElement">
  <data key="d0">isIntegerSchemaElement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A private method in Args that returns true when a schema element tail equals #.&lt;SEP&gt;isIntegerSchemaElement is a method in Args called by parseSchemaElement to determine whether a schema element tail represents an Integer element.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-011</data>
