  <data key="d0">GetInt</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">GetInt is a public method in Args that retrieves an integer argument by obtaining an ArgumentMarshaler and casting the Get Method result to Integer.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
