<node id="SetIntArg">
  <data key="d0">SetIntArg</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">SetIntArg is a private method in Args that assigns the next argument string to an integer marshaler and handles missing or invalid integer conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-009</data>
