<node id="SetBooleanArg">
  <data key="d0">SetBooleanArg</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">SetBooleanArg is a private method in Args that assigns a boolean argument by invoking the Set Method on the corresponding boolean marshaler.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-009</data>
