<node id="Refactoring Of Args">
  <data key="d0">Refactoring Of Args</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Refactoring Of Args is the code-change process in the Args class that introduces a single marshalers map and reduces dependence on the separate boolean, string, and integer maps.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-010</data>
