</node>
<node id="marshalers">
  <data key="d0">marshalers</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">marshalers is a private HashMap field in Args that maps Character keys to ArgumentMarshaler values and consolidates separate Boolean, String, and Integer argument maps.&lt;SEP&gt;marshalers is a field in Args introduced as a consolidated map for ArgumentMarshaler instances by character key.&lt;SEP&gt;marshalers is a private field of Args of type Map&lt;Character, ArgumentMarshaler&gt;, initialized as a HashMap, that stores schema element identifiers mapped to their ArgumentMarshaler instances.&lt;SEP&gt;marshalers is a collection used by setArgument to retrieve an ArgumentMarshaler for an argument character.&lt;SEP&gt;marshalers is a map-like structure used to store ArgumentMarshaler instances keyed by argument character.&lt;SEP&gt;Collection or map in Args that associates argument characters with ArgumentMarshaler instances and is used by getBoolean, getString, and getInt.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598420</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ClassCastException">
  <data key="d0">ClassCastException</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">ClassCastException is a Java exception class caught by Args retrieval methods when an ArgumentMarshaler value has an incompatible type.&lt;SEP&gt;Java exception caught in getBoolean and getString when the marshaler value cannot be cast to the expected type.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598420</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
