<node id="Args.parse">
  <data key="d0">Args.parse</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Args.parse is a private method invoked by the Args constructor. It parses the schema and command-line arguments and assigns the result to the valid field.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598420</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Args.parseSchema">
  <data key="d0">Args.parseSchema</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Args.parseSchema is a private method that splits the schema string on commas and calls Args.parseSchemaElement for each non-empty trimmed schema element.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598420</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Args.parseSchemaElement">
  <data key="d0">Args.parseSchemaElement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Args.parseSchemaElement is a private method that validates a schema element identifier, selects the appropriate ArgumentMarshaler based on the element tail, and throws ParseException for invalid element formats.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598420</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Args.validateSchemaElementId">
  <data key="d0">Args.validateSchemaElementId</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Args.validateSchemaElementId is a private method that verifies a schema element identifier is a letter and throws ParseException when it is not.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598420</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Args.isBooleanSchemaElement">
  <data key="d0">Args.isBooleanSchemaElement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Args.isBooleanSchemaElement is a private method that returns true when a schema element tail has zero length.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790598420</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
