<node id="Args.isIntegerSchemaElement">
  <data key="d0">Args.isIntegerSchemaElement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Args.isIntegerSchemaElement is a private method that returns true when a schema element tail equals the number sign symbol.</data>
