<node id="Args.parseElements">
  <data key="d0">Args.parseElements</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Args.parseElements is a private method that iterates over the characters of an argument string after the leading hyphen and calls Args.parseElement for each character.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-14.txt</data>
