  <data key="d0">booleanValue</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Boolean field in BooleanArgumentMarshaler initialized to false and set to true by the marshaler set method.&lt;SEP&gt;booleanValue is a field in BooleanArgumentMarshaler that stores the boolean argument value.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-015</data>
