<node id="Rubik's Cube">
  <data key="d0">Rubik's Cube</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Rubik's Cube is a puzzle referenced as an analogy for the stepwise, incremental nature of Refactoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Rubik's Cube is a puzzle used as a metaphor for refactoring, where many small steps are required to achieve a larger goal.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-015</data>
