  <data key="d2">MISSING_DOUBLE is an ArgsException.ErrorCode value representing a missing double parameter.&lt;SEP&gt;MISSING_DOUBLE is an ArgsException.ErrorCode constant used when a double argument value is absent during argument parsing.</data>
