  <data key="d2">INVALID_DOUBLE is an ArgsException.ErrorCode value representing an invalid double parameter.&lt;SEP&gt;INVALID_DOUBLE is an ArgsException.ErrorCode constant used when a double argument value cannot be parsed as a number.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-019</data>
