  <data key="d2">INVALID_ARGUMENT_NAME is an ArgsException.ErrorCode value representing an invalid argument name.&lt;SEP&gt;INVALID_ARGUMENT_NAME is an ArgsException.ErrorCode constant asserted when a schema contains a non-letter argument name such as '*'.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-019</data>
