  <data key="d2">INVALID_FORMAT is an ArgsException.ErrorCode value representing a malformed argument format.&lt;SEP&gt;INVALID_FORMAT is an ArgsException.ErrorCode constant asserted when a schema format such as 'f~' is invalid.</data>
