  <data key="d0">Partitioning</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A software design practice described as creating appropriate places for different kinds of code, applied to moving code out of Args and into ArgsException and separate marshaler files.&lt;SEP&gt;Partitioning is the practice of creating appropriate places to put different kinds of code.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-021</data>
