<node id="Chapter">
  <data key="d0">Chapter</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Chapter is the document section in which the final solution appeared at the start and the refactoring discussion occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;The chapter is a brief treatment of concurrent programming that covers concurrent update, synchronization, locking, threads, deadlock, and code instrumentation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-010</data>
