<node id="Modules">
  <data key="d0">Modules</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Modules are code units that can become intertwined and create hidden and tangled dependencies as code rots.&lt;SEP&gt;Individual software modules for which the simplest thing that can possibly work should be used.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f8b0f36a5c42d0808fec00a058082be8-chunk-006</data>
