<node id="Thread Management">
  <data key="d0">Thread Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The activity of creating, scheduling, and controlling threads, which should be isolated from non-concurrency code to simplify concurrency issue tracking.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-001</data>
