  <data key="d0">Possible Paths Of Execution</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The set of interleaved thread executions that can produce different observable outcomes for concurrent code.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
