  <data key="d0">run</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Method declared in the anonymous Runnable implementation inside the process method, executing client message retrieval, delay, reply sending, and socket closing.&lt;SEP&gt;run is the Runnable method in the Server class that prints a start message and repeatedly accepts and processes client sockets while keepProcessing remains true.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-011</data>
