<node id="process">
  <data key="d0">process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Server method that receives a Socket, creates a Runnable client handler, and starts a Thread to process the client connection.&lt;SEP&gt;process is a Server method that receives a message from a Socket, pauses for 1000 milliseconds, sends a processed reply, and closes the socket.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-011</data>
