  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Excel is a date-capable software application referenced as a requirement that SerialDate should match at least in date behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Excel is a spreadsheet application that uses the date convention 1-Jan-1900 = 1 and is described as having a deliberate 1900 leap-year bug.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-033</data>
