<node id="Object Refinery Limited">
  <data key="d0">Object Refinery Limited</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Object Refinery Limited is an organization identified in source-code headers as a copyright holder and contributor to the JCommon class library. Its copyright notices for JCommon and related source files generally span the period from 2000 to 2005, with some files, including SerialDateTests.java, specifically credited for 2001–2005.

The organization is also associated with David Gilbert, who authored or created files for Object Refinery Limited. Specifically, it is listed as the copyright holder for SerialDate.java, SerialDateTests.java, MonthConstants.java, SpreadsheetDate.java, and RelativeDayOfWeekRule.java, and it is identified as the employer or organizational context for Gilbert’s work on those files.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-043</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
