<node id="SerialDate.Java">
  <data key="d0">SerialDate.Java</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">SerialDate.Java is the Java source file containing the SerialDate class constants and methods shown in the listing.&lt;SEP&gt;SerialDate.Java is the source code file identified in Listing B-1 that contains the SerialDate implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;SerialDate.Java is a Java source code file shown as Listing B-1 that provides static utility methods for converting and validating date-related codes, including month codes, quarters, month names, and week-in-month codes.&lt;SEP&gt;SerialDate.Java is the Java source file presented in Listing B-1, containing the implementation fragments shown for the SerialDate class.&lt;SEP&gt;A Java source code listing that contains the SerialDate class and its method declarations.&lt;SEP&gt;SerialDate.Java is the Java source listing referenced in the input and contains the SerialDate utility methods.&lt;SEP&gt;SerialDate.Java is the Java source file shown in Listing B-1 and containing the SerialDate class code.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
