<node id="LEAP_YEAR_AGGREGATE_DAYS_TO_END_OF_PRECEDING_MONTH">
  <data key="d0">LEAP_YEAR_AGGREGATE_DAYS_TO_END_OF_PRECEDING_MONTH</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">LEAP_YEAR_AGGREGATE_DAYS_TO_END_OF_PRECEDING_MONTH is a static integer array in SerialDate storing the number of days in a leap year up to the end of the preceding month.&lt;SEP&gt;LEAP_YEAR_AGGREGATE_DAYS_TO_END_OF_PRECEDING_MONTH is a leap-year variant of the aggregate days-to-end-of-preceding-month table used when converting serial numbers to day, month, and year.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-036</data>
