<node id="PRECEDING">
  <data key="d0">PRECEDING</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">PRECEDING is a public static final integer constant in SerialDate for specifying a preceding day of the week relative to a fixed date, with value -1.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
