</node>
<node id="Week-In-Month">
  <data key="d0">Week-In-Month</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Week-In-Month is a date abstraction represented by integer constants such as first, second, third, fourth, or last week in a month, validated by isValidWeekInMonthCode.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599013</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Default Locale">
  <data key="d0">Default Locale</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Default Locale is the locale context used by the SerialDate.Java month-name conversion methods to obtain long and short month names.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
