  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">First Week In Month is a Java constant represented as FIRST_WEEK_IN_MONTH in SerialDate and accepted by isValidWeekInMonthCode as a valid week-in-the-month code.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-016</data>
