<node id="Day Of Week Adjustment">
  <data key="d0">Day Of Week Adjustment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Day Of Week Adjustment is a partially shown SerialDate procedure that validates a target day-of-week code, computes an adjustment from the base date's day of week, and returns an adjusted date by adding days.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599048</data>
