<node id="Add Days">
  <data key="d0">Add Days</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Add Days is a static SerialDate arithmetic method that adds an integer number of days to a base SerialDate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-018</data>
