<node id="Last Day Of Month">
  <data key="d0">Last Day Of Month</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Last Day Of Month is a static SerialDate method that determines the last day of a supplied month and year.&lt;SEP&gt;Last Day Of Month is the maximum day in a month that a date can have when the month is incremented.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e6b59836a05af0c112c0d24b77e2c123-chunk-005</data>
