<node id="Get Day Of Week">
  <data key="d0">Get Day Of Week</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Get Day Of Week is a SerialDate accessor method that returns the day-of-week value for a base date.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
