<node id="Java Date">
  <data key="d0">Java Date</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Java Date is a java.util.Date object supplied to Create Instance and converted through GregorianCalendar into day, month, and year values.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
