<node id="Microsoft Excel For Windows">
  <data key="d0">Microsoft Excel For Windows</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Microsoft Excel For Windows is a spreadsheet application whose date numbering system is referenced as corresponding, almost, to the SerialDate serial number convention.&lt;SEP&gt;A Windows spreadsheet application whose date numbering system is stated to be almost corresponding to the SerialDate serial number convention.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
