</node>
<node id="1 January 1900">
  <data key="d0">1 January 1900</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">1 January 1900 is the date used to define the SerialDate serial numbering convention, where this date corresponds to serial number 2.&lt;SEP&gt;A date reference value used to define the SerialDate serial number convention, specifically mapped to serial number 2.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599048</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Microsoft Excel for Windows">
  <data key="d0">Microsoft Excel for Windows</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Microsoft Excel for Windows is a spreadsheet application whose date numbering system is referenced in the SerialDate comment.&lt;SEP&gt;A Windows spreadsheet application whose date numbering system is almost corresponding to the Date Serial Number convention.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Excel for Windows is a spreadsheet application whose date numbering system is described as almost corresponding to the serial number returned by toSerial.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-034</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599048</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lotus 1-2-3">
  <data key="d0">Lotus 1-2-3</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A spreadsheet application whose date numbering system is stated to be almost corresponding to the SerialDate serial number convention.&lt;SEP&gt;Lotus 1-2-3 is a spreadsheet application whose date numbering system is described as almost corresponding to the serial number returned by toSerial.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-034</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599048</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Date Serial Number">
  <data key="d0">Date Serial Number</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A serial date numbering convention in which 1 January 1900 is represented as 2 and which closely corresponds to the numbering systems of Microsoft Excel For Windows and Lotus 1-2-3.&lt;SEP&gt;The integer serial number used by SpreadsheetDate to represent a date, where 1 January 1900 equals 2, and the numbering system almost corresponds to Microsoft Excel for Windows and Lotus 1-2-3.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-034</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599048</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="toDate">
  <data key="d0">toDate</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An abstract SerialDate method that returns the date as a java.util.Date value.&lt;SEP&gt;toDate is a method that returns a java.util.Date equivalent to the SpreadsheetDate by using Calendar and the year, month, and day values.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-034</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599048</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="isOn">
  <data key="d0">isOn</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An abstract SerialDate method that returns true if the current date represents the same date as another SerialDate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599048</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="isBefore">
  <data key="d0">isBefore</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An abstract SerialDate method that returns true if the current date represents an earlier date than another SerialDate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599048</data>
