</node>
<node id="isOnOrBefore">
  <data key="d0">isOnOrBefore</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An abstract SerialDate method that accepts another SerialDate and returns a boolean comparison result.&lt;SEP&gt;isOnOrBefore is an abstract method of SerialDate that takes a SerialDate argument and returns a boolean result for date comparison.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
