<node id="Time Of Day Convention">
  <data key="d0">Time Of Day Convention</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A convention needed to represent the time-of-day component when a SerialDate is converted to a java.util.Date because java.util.Date has more precision than SerialDate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599048</data>
