  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">SerialDateTest.java is a Java source file listing, identified as Listing B-2, that contains the JCommon copyright and license header.&lt;SEP&gt;A Java test source file containing test methods that verify date behavior in the SerialDate class.&lt;SEP&gt;SerialDateTest.java is a Java test source file containing test methods that verify SerialDate behavior and use MonthConstants constants.</data>
