<node id="SpreadsheetDate.java">
  <data key="d0">SpreadsheetDate.java</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">SpreadsheetDate.java is a Java source file listing that contains the SpreadsheetDate class, comments about Excel date behavior, and constructor implementations.&lt;SEP&gt;SpreadsheetDate.java is a Java source file associated with the JCommon library that represents a date using an integer in a manner similar to Microsoft Excel, supports dates from 1-Jan-1900 to 31-Dec-9999, and was originally authored by David Gilbert.&lt;SEP&gt;SpreadsheetDate.java is the Java source file or listing shown as Listing B-5 continued and contains the method definitions associated with the SpreadsheetDate class.&lt;SEP&gt;SpreadsheetDate.java is a Java source file listing that presents methods operating on SerialDate objects for date comparison and range checking.&lt;SEP&gt;The source file listed as Listing B-16 containing the final version of the SpreadsheetDate class.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-043</data>
