  <data key="d0">Contributors</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Contributors is a group credited alongside Object Refinery Limited as a copyright holder for the RelativeDayOfWeekRule.java file.&lt;SEP&gt;Contributors is the collective group of contributors to JCommon and RelativeDayOfWeekRule.java, listed with Object Refinery Limited as copyright holder.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-037</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
