<node id="SerialDate.SERIAL_LOWER_BOUND">
  <data key="d0">SerialDate.SERIAL_LOWER_BOUND</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">SerialDate.SERIAL_LOWER_BOUND is a constant representing the lower bound for SerialDate serial numbers, and calcDayMonthYear subtracts it from the serial value when converting a serial number.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-036</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
