  <data key="d2">Listing B-6 is a document listing that presents the source file RelativeDayOfWeekRule.java.&lt;SEP&gt;A continued source-code listing identified as Listing B-6 that presents RelativeDayOfWeekRule.java.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-038</data>
