<node id="AnnualDateRule">
  <data key="d0">AnnualDateRule</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">AnnualDateRule is a Java class that serves as the superclass of RelativeDayOfWeekRule and represents an annual date rule usable as a reference sub-rule.&lt;SEP&gt;A Java class that represents an annual date rule used as the sub-rule or reference rule for RelativeDayOfWeekRule.&lt;SEP&gt;AnnualDateRule is a Java class shown with a noise comment on its default constructor.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ecee1e439eb5fb52d346911e1683e490-chunk-004</data>
