</node>
<node id="DayAndMonthRule">
  <data key="d0">DayAndMonthRule</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">DayAndMonthRule is a Java class instantiated in the default constructor of RelativeDayOfWeekRule to build a rule for the Monday following 1 January.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-037</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-18.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790599067</data>
