  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DayDate.plusDays is a DayDate method that returns a new DayDate by adding a specified number of days to the current ordinal day using DayDateFactory.&lt;SEP&gt;DayDate.plusDays is a DayDate method referenced for returning a date offset by a specified number of days.</data>
