<node id="DayDate.plusMonths">
  <data key="d0">DayDate.plusMonths</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DayDate.plusMonths is a DayDate method that returns a new DayDate after adding months, converts month and year values to ordinal form, and corrects the last day of the resulting month.</data>
