  <data key="d0">DayDate.correctLastDayOfMonth</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DayDate.correctLastDayOfMonth is a private DayDate method that caps a day value to the last day of a given month and year using DateUtil.</data>
