  <data key="d0">DayDate.getPreviousDayOfWeek</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DayDate.getPreviousDayOfWeek is a DayDate method that returns the previous DayDate corresponding to a target Day by applying a day offset through plusDays.</data>
