  <data key="d0">DayDate.getFollowingDayOfWeek</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DayDate.getFollowingDayOfWeek is a DayDate method that returns the following DayDate corresponding to a target Day by applying a day offset through plusDays.</data>
