  <data key="d0">DayDate.getNearestDayOfWeek</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DayDate.getNearestDayOfWeek is a DayDate method that returns the nearest DayDate corresponding to a target Day by comparing offsets to future and previous target days.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-039</data>
