  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DayDateFactory.makeDate is a factory method used to create DayDate instances, including from an ordinal day or from day, month, and year arguments.&lt;SEP&gt;DayDateFactory.makeDate is a method referenced for constructing a DayDate from a day, month, and year.</data>
