  <data key="d0">DayDate.getDayOfWeek</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DayDate.getDayOfWeek is a DayDate method that provides the current day-of-week value, converted to an integer for calculating previous, following, and nearest day-of-week offsets.&lt;SEP&gt;DayDate.getDayOfWeek is a method that computes the day of week from an ordinal day and a starting Day offset relative to Day.SUNDAY.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-040</data>
