  <data key="d0">DayDate.getOrdinalDay</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DayDate.getOrdinalDay is an abstract DayDate method that returns the integer ordinal day number representing the date from a fixed origin.&lt;SEP&gt;DayDate.getOrdinalDay is a method referenced to retrieve an ordinal day value used for comparisons and day-of-week calculation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-040</data>
