  <data key="d0">DateUtil.lastDayOfMonth</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DateUtil.lastDayOfMonth is a utility method called by DayDate.correctLastDayOfMonth to determine the last day of a month for a given month and year.&lt;SEP&gt;DateUtil.lastDayOfMonth is a method referenced for calculating the last day of a given month and year.&lt;SEP&gt;A DateUtil method used by SpreadsheetDate to validate whether a day argument is valid for a specified month and year.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-043</data>
