<node id="Month.quarter">
  <data key="d0">Month.quarter</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Month.quarter is an instance method of Month that returns the calendar quarter number computed as 1 + (index - 1) / 3.&lt;SEP&gt;Month.quarter is a method that calculates the calendar quarter from the month index.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-041</data>
