  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Month.toString is an instance method of Month that returns the full month name from DateFormatSymbols using index - 1.&lt;SEP&gt;Month.toString is a method that returns a month name from the DateFormatSymbols months array.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-041</data>
