  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Month.toShortString is an instance method of Month that returns the short month name from DateFormatSymbols using index - 1.&lt;SEP&gt;Month.toShortString is a Month method whose visible implementation begins with a return statement for a short month string.</data>
