  <data key="d0">DateInterval.CLOSED</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">DateInterval.CLOSED is a DateInterval enum constant representing a closed interval. The isIn implementation for DateInterval.CLOSED returns true when d &gt;= left &amp;&amp; d &lt;= right.&lt;SEP&gt;DateInterval.CLOSED is a DateInterval constant used by the two-argument DayDate.isInRange method as the default interval type.</data>
