  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DateInterval.isIn is an abstract boolean method of DateInterval that determines whether a value is within the left and right bounds for the selected interval constant.&lt;SEP&gt;DateInterval.isIn is a DateInterval method invoked by DayDate.isInRange to test whether an ordinal day lies within a range.</data>
