<node id="Days Since Modification">
  <data key="d0">Days Since Modification</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Days Since Modification is an intention-revealing variable name that specifies a duration measured in days since modification.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f209a7a16ee116e66dcaca0799c06baa-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-02.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603331</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="File Age In Days">
  <data key="d0">File Age In Days</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">File Age In Days is an intention-revealing variable name that specifies a file's age measured in days.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f209a7a16ee116e66dcaca0799c06baa-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-02.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603331</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Value Four">
  <data key="d0">Value Four</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Value Four is the unexplained numeric constant 4 used in the original code to represent the flagged state.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f209a7a16ee116e66dcaca0799c06baa-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-02.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603331</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Container">
  <data key="d0">Container</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A Container is a software object that holds a collection of items, such as accounts, and should be named according to its actual type.&lt;SEP&gt;An interface implemented by ContainerBase and referenced as the type of a parent field in the listing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f209a7a16ee116e66dcaca0799c06baa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ecee1e439eb5fb52d346911e1683e490-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-02.txt&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-04.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790604159</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="accountList">
  <data key="d0">accountList</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">accountList is a code identifier for a container of accounts that may misleadingly imply the container is a List.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f209a7a16ee116e66dcaca0799c06baa-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-02.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603331</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
