<node id="C++">
  <data key="d0">C++</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">C++ is a programming language mentioned in connection with a former naming practice by Uncle Bob.&lt;SEP&gt;C++ is a programming language mentioned as requiring functions to be defined or declared before they are used.&lt;SEP&gt;C++ is a programming language mentioned as the context where the Scissors Rule was commonly practiced for instance variable placement.&lt;SEP&gt;C++ is a programming language mentioned as part of the progression from assembly language and C toward Java.&lt;SEP&gt;C++ is a programming language mentioned as not having Checked Exceptions despite attempts, while still allowing Robust Software.&lt;SEP&gt;C++ is a programming language invented by Bjarne Stroustrup.&lt;SEP&gt;C++ is a programming language invented by Bjarne and is mentioned in connection with efficiency and clean code.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f209a7a16ee116e66dcaca0799c06baa-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98268aa1e2e5692cb0faaf2b6fae4a09-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-02.txt&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-05.txt&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-07.txt&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-01.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790606209</data>
