<node id="Encodings">
  <data key="d0">Encodings</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Encodings refer to encoding type or scope information into names and are described as adding deciphering burden, making names hard to pronounce, easy to mistype, and creating unnecessary mental burden.</data>
