<node id="Fortran">
  <data key="d0">Fortran</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Fortran is a name-length-challenged language that forced encodings by making the first letter of a name a code for the type.&lt;SEP&gt;A programming language mentioned as part of the historical era in which systems were composed of programs, subprograms, and functions.&lt;SEP&gt;A programming language used by Ron Jeffries at the start of a career.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f209a7a16ee116e66dcaca0799c06baa-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-004</data>
