  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Constructor is the direct constructor usage new Complex(23.0) presented as less preferred than a static factory method.&lt;SEP&gt;Constructor is a Java reflection type used as the return type of getTestConstructor in the TestSuite snippet.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f209a7a16ee116e66dcaca0799c06baa-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-002</data>
