<node id="Code Readability">
  <data key="d0">Code Readability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The quality of code that reads like paragraphs and sentences and can be improved by naming rules.&lt;SEP&gt;A property of code indicating how easily the code can be read; greater readability makes writing code easier.</data>
