</node>
<node id="Developers">
  <data key="d0">Developers</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Human programmers who may object to renaming and who may maintain code written by others.&lt;SEP&gt;The professional people responsible for writing, maintaining, and defending code, providing schedules, and protecting the codebase with professional honor.&lt;SEP&gt;Developers are experienced software professionals who know previous messes slow developers down and who feel pressure to meet deadlines.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of software team members who maintain code, raise complaints about tests, and provide estimates.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f209a7a16ee116e66dcaca0799c06baa-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e6b59836a05af0c112c0d24b77e2c123-chunk-001</data>
