  <data key="d0">Listing 3-1</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Listing 3-1 is a code listing discussed as containing steps at many different levels of abstraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Listing 3-1 is a code listing described as doing many things, including creating buffers, fetching pages, searching for inherited pages, rendering paths, appending arcane strings, and generating HTML.&lt;SEP&gt;A code listing from FitNesse showing the long testableHtml function in HtmlUtil.java, characterized by duplicated code, odd strings, and multiple abstraction levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Listing 3-1 is a code listing containing an algorithm repeated across Set Up, Suite Set Up, Tear Down, and Suite Tear Down cases.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-03.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Listing 3-2">
  <data key="d0">Listing 3-2</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Listing 3-2 is a code listing discussed as having two levels of abstraction and being possible to shrink.&lt;SEP&gt;Listing 3-2 is a code listing described as a function that is easy to read and understand; Listing 3-2 is stated to be shortened to Listing 3-3.&lt;SEP&gt;A refactored nine-line code listing in HtmlUtil.java that makes the function intent easier to understand.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-03.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="testableHtml">
  <data key="d0">testableHtml</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A long Java function in HtmlUtil.java that includes setup and teardown pages in a test page and renders the resulting page as HTML.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-000</data>
