<node id="renderPageWithSetupsAndTeardowns">
  <data key="d0">renderPageWithSetupsAndTeardowns</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">renderPageWithSetupsAndTeardowns is a static Java method that accepts PageData and a boolean isSuite, optionally includes setup and teardown pages, and returns page HTML.&lt;SEP&gt;A refactored Java function in HtmlUtil.java that performs setup and teardown page inclusion and HTML rendering with a clearer name and structure.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-001</data>
