  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A refactoring technique used to break a long function into smaller pieces and improve the communication of intent.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-03.txt</data>
