<node id="Test Page">
  <data key="d0">Test Page</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Test Page is the page whose content is included during the setup and teardown process described in the example.&lt;SEP&gt;A page that receives setup and teardown page inclusion and is rendered into HTML by the FitNesse function.&lt;SEP&gt;Test Page is a page identified by isTestPage as a test page, into which setups and teardowns are included when rendering.&lt;SEP&gt;A page object referenced as testPage in the Setup Teardown Includer code and supplied to the Get Inherited Page method of Page Crawler Impl.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-03.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Setup Page">
  <data key="d0">Setup Page</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A page included into a test page as part of test setup.</data>
