<node id="Subroutine">
  <data key="d0">Subroutine</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A programming construct mentioned in the early days of programming, alongside routines, as used to compose systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Subroutine is a reusable code construct whose invention is associated with efforts to eliminate duplication.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-007</data>
