<node id="Sparkle">
  <data key="d0">Sparkle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sparkle is a Java/Swing program shown by Kent Beck. Sparkle produces a Cinderella-like sparkle visual effect from a cursor through a simulated gravitational field, and the functions in Sparkle were two, three, or four lines long.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-001</data>
