  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">One thing is a guideline describing a function that performs a single coherent responsibility by staying at one level of abstraction.&lt;SEP&gt;One Thing is a clean-code principle that an object or method should perform only a single responsibility.</data>
