  <data key="d2">Eclipse is an integrated development environment mentioned as making it trivial to change names during naming experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;The organization associated with the AspectJ reference and the Eclipse AspectJ book.&lt;SEP&gt;A modern coding tool in which renaming is described as inexpensive.</data>
