<node id="Ward">
  <data key="d0">Ward</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Ward is the individual associated with the principle that clean code routines turn out to be pretty much what the reader expected.&lt;SEP&gt;Ward is a person referenced for a statement about clean code and beauty, expecting that clean code will be simple, obvious, and unsurprising to read.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-005</data>
