<node id="transform">
  <data key="d0">transform</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">transform is a method shown in two forms, StringBuffer transform(StringBuffer in) and void transform(StringBuffer out), with the return-value form recommended for a transformation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-03.txt</data>
