  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">writeField is a method shown as writeField(name) and writeField(outputStream, name), with the single-argument form described as easier to understand.&lt;SEP&gt;A method used to write a named field, which can be made a member of outputStream or refactored into monadic form.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-03.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
