<node id="attributeExists">
  <data key="d0">attributeExists</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">attributeExists is a query function used to check whether a named attribute exists before setting the attribute.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-03.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="setAttribute">
  <data key="d0">setAttribute</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">setAttribute is a command function used to set the value of a named attribute after the existence check.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-03.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Username Attribute">
  <data key="d0">Username Attribute</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Username Attribute is the named attribute used in the set example and referenced by attributeExists and setAttribute.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-03.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="E_OK">
  <data key="d0">E_OK</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">E_OK is an error-code value used in the example to indicate successful completion of a command function.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-03.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Error Code">
  <data key="d0">Error Code</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Error Code is a returned value from a command function that forces the caller to handle errors immediately and can create nested conditionals.&lt;SEP&gt;Error Code is a returned or enumerated value used to indicate a failure condition.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-007</data>
