<node id="Object-Oriented Programming">
  <data key="d0">Object-Oriented Programming</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Object-Oriented Programming is a programming strategy that concentrates code into base classes to reduce redundancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Object-Oriented Programming is a programming paradigm that the passage says is undermined by EJB2 because one bean cannot inherit from another bean and data transfer objects duplicate data without behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Object-Oriented Programming is a programming paradigm referenced as OO and associated with Ward Cunningham's thought leadership.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f8b0f36a5c42d0808fec00a058082be8-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-004</data>
