  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Goto Statement is a control-flow statement discussed as unsuitable for small functions and discouraged under structured programming.&lt;SEP&gt;Control-flow statement that only makes sense in large functions and should therefore be avoided.</data>
