  <data key="d0">Single-entry Single-exit Rule</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Rule contrasted with multiple return, break, and continue statements in the discussion of small functions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70106d3c6c60a2a04b530f45336de970-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-03.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790603783</data>
