  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The concept of noisy Javadocs that are redundant and reflect a misplaced desire to provide documentation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ecee1e439eb5fb52d346911e1683e490-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-04.txt</data>
