<node id="Commented-Out Code">
  <data key="d0">Commented-Out Code</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Disabled code left in a source file, discouraged because readers may assume it is important and avoid deleting it.&lt;SEP&gt;Code that is commented out rather than deleted, as shown in the PNG-writing example, and is discussed as potentially unnecessary when a source code control system preserves history.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ecee1e439eb5fb52d346911e1683e490-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ecee1e439eb5fb52d346911e1683e490-chunk-006</data>
