  <data key="d2">PrimeGenerator is a Java class with a generatePrimes method that generates prime numbers using helper methods and restrained comments.&lt;SEP&gt;PrimeGenerator is a Java class that generates an array of prime numbers using static helper methods and tracking of prime factor multiples.&lt;SEP&gt;PrimeGenerator is a Java class that uses static variables and helper methods to generate prime numbers and is not intended to be instantiated as an object.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ecee1e439eb5fb52d346911e1683e490-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-004</data>
