<node id="notFoundResponse">
  <data key="d0">notFoundResponse</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">notFoundResponse is a method that returns a response produced by NotFoundResponder when a page is not found.&lt;SEP&gt;notFoundResponse is a method that throws Exception and returns a response by creating a NotFoundResponder and calling makeResponse with a FitNesseContext and Request.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-05.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790604436</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="makePageResponse">
  <data key="d0">makePageResponse</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">makePageResponse is a method that constructs a SimpleResponse containing HTML for the loaded page.&lt;SEP&gt;makePageResponse is a private method that renders a page title, builds HTML, constructs a SimpleResponse, sets max age to zero, and returns the response.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-003</data>
