<node id="SimpleResponse">
  <data key="d0">SimpleResponse</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">SimpleResponse is a response object created and configured by makePageResponse.&lt;SEP&gt;SimpleResponse is a response object created by makePageResponse and configured with zero max age and HTML content.&lt;SEP&gt;SimpleResponse is a response type returned by SerializedPageResponder and inspected for content type and content.&lt;SEP&gt;A response type representing content and content type returned by a responder.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e6b59836a05af0c112c0d24b77e2c123-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e6b59836a05af0c112c0d24b77e2c123-chunk-002</data>
