<node id="Instance Variables">
  <data key="d0">Instance Variables</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Instance Variables are class-level variables that the text recommends declaring at the top of a Java class in one well-known place.&lt;SEP&gt;Instance Variables are class variables. Classes should have a small number of instance variables, and methods of a class should manipulate one or more of those variables.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-001</data>
