<node id="Request">
  <data key="d0">Request</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Request is a request object supplied to notFoundResponse for producing a response.&lt;SEP&gt;Request is a type used as a parameter and field in WikiPageResponder to represent an incoming request.&lt;SEP&gt;Request is a Java class used as a private field in FitNesseExpediter.&lt;SEP&gt;Request is a request object configured with a resource and input arguments such as type.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e6b59836a05af0c112c0d24b77e2c123-chunk-002</data>
