<node id="FitNesseContext">
  <data key="d0">FitNesseContext</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">FitNesseContext is a context object supplied to request-handling methods in the code example.&lt;SEP&gt;FitNesseContext is a context type passed to WikiPageResponder methods and used to obtain page-crawling capability.&lt;SEP&gt;FitNesseContext is a Java class used as a field and constructor parameter in FitNesseExpediter and as a field and constructor parameter in FitNesseServer.&lt;SEP&gt;FitNesseContext is a software context object supplied to FitNesseServer and passed to FitNesseExpediter.&lt;SEP&gt;FitNesseContext is a context object constructed from the test root and passed to SerializedPageResponder.&lt;SEP&gt;A context object created with a root page and passed to a page responder.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e6b59836a05af0c112c0d24b77e2c123-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e6b59836a05af0c112c0d24b77e2c123-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-05.txt&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-09.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790606382</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
