  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Quadratic is a class shown as a code example for using white space to accentuate operator precedence in root calculations.&lt;SEP&gt;Quadratic is a Java class shown with root calculation methods that use spacing to separate factors and terms according to operator precedence.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-004</data>
