  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Quadratic.root2 is a static method in Quadratic that computes another root using a determinant and white-space formatting.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-05.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790604436</data>
