<node id="determinant">
  <data key="d0">determinant</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">determinant is a helper function called by Quadratic.root1 and Quadratic.root2 to compute a determinant value.&lt;SEP&gt;determinant is a private static method in Quadratic that returns b*b - 4*a*c.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-004</data>
