<node id="root2">
  <data key="d0">root2</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">root2 is a static method in Quadratic that returns the negative root using the formula (-b - Math.sqrt(determinant)) / (2*a).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ae06dfc90c814559f684ae92cc598260-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-05.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790604436</data>
