<node id="EJB3">
  <data key="d0">EJB3</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Version 3 of the EJB standard that largely follows the Spring model and declaratively supports cross-cutting concerns using XML and Java 5 annotations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f8b0f36a5c42d0808fec00a058082be8-chunk-004</data>
