<node id="Beautiful Code">
  <data key="d0">Beautiful Code</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Code that is clean, appears as expected, and makes the language look made for the problem.&lt;SEP&gt;Beautiful code is code that makes the programming language look as if the language were made for the problem, placing responsibility on the programmer rather than the language.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-005</data>
