  <data key="d0">Dependency Inversion Principle</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A principle of design referenced in the excerpt and described in depth in Agile Software Development: Principles, Patterns, and Practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Dependency Inversion Principle is a class design principle stating that classes should depend upon abstractions rather than concrete details.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d58f62a4832abf3c8bbf730215895c6d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-006</data>
