  <data key="d0">RSpec: Behavior Driven Development for Ruby Programmers</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">RSpec: Behavior Driven Development for Ruby Programmers is a book authored by Aslak Hellesøy and David Chelimsky and published by Pragmatic Bookshelf in 2008.</data>
