  <data key="d0">JFrame</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A Java Swing class representing a top-level GUI window. SuperDashboard is a derivative of JFrame.&lt;SEP&gt;A Java class extended by SuperDashboard.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-001</data>
