  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A class member with public access that, according to class organization, has seldom a good reason in Java classes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-10.txt</data>
