<node id="generate">
  <data key="d0">generate</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">generate is a protected static method in PrimeGenerator. The generate method initializes prime storage and returns an int array of the requested number of primes.&lt;SEP&gt;generate is an abstract public method declared in Sql that each derived SQL class overrides to produce the appropriate SQL statement string.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-10.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790606393</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="print">
  <data key="d0">print</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">print is a public method in RowColumnPagePrinter. The print method prints an int array page by page.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">chapter-10.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1790606393</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
