  <data key="d2">isPrime is a private static method in PrimeGenerator. The isPrime method determines whether a candidate number is a prime.&lt;SEP&gt;isPrime is a static method in the PrimeGenerator class that determines whether a candidate number is prime by delegating to helper checks.</data>
