  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">isLeastRelevantMultipleOfNextLargerPrimeFactor is a method referenced by the isPrime method in PrimeGenerator to test a candidate number against the next larger prime factor condition.&lt;SEP&gt;isLeastRelevantMultipleOfNextLargerPrimeFactor is a static helper method in PrimeGenerator that checks whether a candidate equals the square of the next larger prime factor.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-004</data>
