<node id="Sql">
  <data key="d0">Sql</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sql is an abstract base class used for SQL statement generation. In the restructured design, Sql remains closed for modification while new SQL behaviors are added through subclasses.&lt;SEP&gt;Sql is a Java class that generates properly formed SQL strings from metadata, supports several statement generation methods, and does not yet support update statements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-005</data>
