  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Refactoring Process is the workflow in which the original program is transformed into the refactored program through many tiny changes, each followed by execution to confirm unchanged behavior.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-004</data>
