  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">selectWithCriteria is a private method originally associated with the Sql class that appears to relate only to select statements.&lt;SEP&gt;selectWithCriteria is a private method in the Sql class that applies to select statements and indicates a potential single responsibility violation.</data>
