<node id="Column">
  <data key="d0">Column</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Column is a code type representing a column definition used in SQL constructors, column lists, and match-based select generation.&lt;SEP&gt;Column is a class type used in the Sql class method signatures to represent column metadata for SQL generation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-005</data>
