<node id="Criteria">
  <data key="d0">Criteria</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Criteria is a code type used by SelectWithCriteriaSql to represent selection conditions for generating select statements.&lt;SEP&gt;Criteria is a class type used in the Sql class select method to represent selection criteria for SQL generation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-005</data>
