<node id="Portfolio">
  <data key="d0">Portfolio</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Portfolio is a class whose value depends on stock price lookup behavior. In the improved design, Portfolio depends on a StockExchange interface rather than a concrete external exchange implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;Portfolio is a software class receiving a StockExchange reference, accepting share additions, and providing a value for the overall portfolio.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-006</data>
