  <data key="d5">1790606393</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="TokyoStockExchange">
  <data key="d0">TokyoStockExchange</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">TokyoStockExchange is a concrete implementation or external API representing a stock exchange, used as an example of a dependency on volatile external data.&lt;SEP&gt;TokyoStockExchange is a concrete software class whose implementation details are contrasted with the StockExchange interface.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4482a25ecfcd0fad59918839a6f47f2a-chunk-006</data>
