  <data key="d8">The chapter connects error handling to clean code by arguing that error handling should not obscure core logic.&lt;SEP&gt;Treating error handling as a separate concern helps write robust clean code.&lt;SEP&gt;Clean code has complete error handling according to an articulated strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;Clean Code exhibits complete error handling as part of close attention to detail.</data>
