<edge source="DayDate" target="SpreadsheetDate">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">SpreadsheetDate is a derivative of DayDate.&lt;SEP&gt;SpreadsheetDate is treated as a derivative implementation of the DayDate base class.&lt;SEP&gt;SpreadsheetDate is described as the only existing implementation of DayDate.&lt;SEP&gt;DayDate serves as the refactored common class for date behavior originally found in SpreadsheetDate.&lt;SEP&gt;SpreadsheetDate is declared to extend DayDate.&lt;SEP&gt;SpreadsheetDate is checked with instanceof DayDate, cast to DayDate in comparison, and returned as DayDate from createInstance.</data>
