<edge source="JCommon" target="Object Refinery Limited">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (JCommon, Object Refinery Limited) represents a copyright attribution in which JCommon is identified as copyright material of Object Refinery Limited and its contributors. This association is consistently described as Object Refinery Limited being a listed copyright holder for JCommon.

Specifically, JCommon’s copyright notice identifies Object Refinery Limited, together with Contributors, as the copyright holders. This attribution is explicitly noted in the header of the MonthConstants.java file. JCommon is also described as a general purpose class library, and the relationship reflects Object Refinery Limited’s role as the primary copyright holder alongside contributing parties.</data>
  <data key="d9">copyright,copyrights,developed by,development,holder,ownership,rights</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b96a37e68a1f0fd9f9aae3b5629b124f-chunk-043</data>
