<edge source="Args" target="Args.java">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Args, Args.java) links the entity Args to the Java source file named Args.java. Across the provided descriptions, Args.java is consistently identified as the source implementation and definition of the public class Args. It is the file whose listing contains the class code and represents the associated source for the class in question.

The descriptions further locate Args.java in a refactoring or input-display context: it is described as the first-draft source-file listing and also as the source file containing the implementation shown after a first refactoring. In that sense, the same file name is associated with the Args class being refactored and with the particular version of the class presented in the input, while the core relationship remains that Args.java holds the Args class definition and implementation.</data>
  <data key="d9">contains,defines,implements,source file,source_file</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-020</data>
