  <data key="d8">IntegerArgumentMarshaler set throws ArgsException with MISSING_INTEGER or INVALID_INTEGER when integer parsing fails.&lt;SEP&gt;IntegerArgumentMarshaler throws ArgsException when integer parsing fails.&lt;SEP&gt;IntegerArgumentMarshaler throws ArgsException when an integer string cannot be parsed.&lt;SEP&gt;IntegerArgumentMarshaler creates and throws ArgsException when an integer parameter is missing or invalid.&lt;SEP&gt;IntegerArgumentMarshaler catches ArgsException while parsing an integer argument, records error state, and rethrows the exception.&lt;SEP&gt;IntegerArgumentMarshaler throws ArgsException when an integer argument is missing or invalid.</data>
  <data key="d9">catches,error handling,error signaling,exception handling,invalid integer,missing integer,rethrows,throws</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-017</data>
