<edge source="ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException" target="setStringArg">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">setStringArg catches ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException when a string parameter is missing.&lt;SEP&gt;setStringArg catches ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException when the current argument value is missing from the argument array.&lt;SEP&gt;setStringArg catches ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException when the next argument value is unavailable.&lt;SEP&gt;setStringArg catches ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException and sets a missing string error code.&lt;SEP&gt;setStringArg catches ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException when no further argument is available.</data>
  <data key="d9">catches,handles</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-013</data>
