</edge>
<edge source="setArgument" target="setStringArg">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">setArgument calls setStringArg for string arguments.&lt;SEP&gt;setArgument calls setStringArg when the character is a string argument.&lt;SEP&gt;setArgument calls setStringArg when the retrieved marshaler is a StringArgumentMarshaler.&lt;SEP&gt;The type-case in setArgument motivates moving setStringArg down into an ArgumentMarshaler derivative.&lt;SEP&gt;setArgument originally called setStringArg for StringArgumentMarshaler instances.</data>
  <data key="d9">StringArgumentMarshaler,calls,dispatch,dispatches,historical dispatch,invokes,refactoring target,type-case</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff1f4d3804316cc277d01b65a1e72073-chunk-015</data>
