</edge>
<edge source="setArgument" target="setBooleanArg">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">setArgument calls setBooleanArg when the character is a boolean argument.&lt;SEP&gt;setArgument calls setBooleanArg for boolean arguments.&lt;SEP&gt;setArgument calls setBooleanArg when the retrieved marshaler is a BooleanArgumentMarshaler.&lt;SEP&gt;The type-case in setArgument motivates moving setBooleanArg down into an ArgumentMarshaler derivative.</data>
  <data key="d9">BooleanArgumentMarshaler,calls,dispatch,dispatches,invokes,refactoring target,type-case</data>
