<edge source="Data Abstraction" target="Data Structure">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Data abstraction hides implementation details, whereas data structures expose data.</data>
  <data key="d9">contrasts,design principle</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-cf9b0cb392cf6be9fae672222887f4bd-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d11">chapter-06.txt</data>
  <data key="d12">1790604467</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Data Abstraction" target="Hiding Implementation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hiding implementation is described as being about abstractions rather than merely placing functions between variables.</data>
  <data key="d9">abstraction,relies on</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-cf9b0cb392cf6be9fae672222887f4bd-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d11">chapter-06.txt</data>
  <data key="d12">1790604467</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Data Abstraction" target="Vehicle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The abstract Vehicle interface exemplifies data abstraction by expressing fuel remaining as a percentage.</data>
  <data key="d9">example,exemplified by</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-cf9b0cb392cf6be9fae672222887f4bd-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d11">chapter-06.txt</data>
  <data key="d12">1790604467</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Data Abstraction" target="Abstract Interfaces">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Data abstraction is accomplished by exposing abstract interfaces.</data>
  <data key="d9">representation,uses</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-cf9b0cb392cf6be9fae672222887f4bd-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d11">chapter-06.txt</data>
  <data key="d12">1790604467</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Data Structure" target="Data/Object Anti-Symmetry">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The anti-symmetry concept characterizes data structures as entities that expose data and lack meaningful functions.</data>
  <data key="d9">concept,defines</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-cf9b0cb392cf6be9fae672222887f4bd-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d11">chapter-06.txt</data>
  <data key="d12">1790604467</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Data Structure" target="Square">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In the procedural example, Square is a simple data structure without behavior.</data>
  <data key="d9">is a kind of,procedural design</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-cf9b0cb392cf6be9fae672222887f4bd-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d11">chapter-06.txt</data>
  <data key="d12">1790604467</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Data Structure" target="Rectangle">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In the procedural example, Rectangle is a simple data structure without behavior.</data>
